id: text-field
name: Text field (filled, with floating label and supporting text)
category: inputs
summary: The Expressive default input: a filled tonal field with a floating label, an active indicator and supporting text.
requires: foundation
@@spec
- Filled style: container surface-4, top corners small (8dp), bottom edge is the 1px outline indicator that thickens to 2px primary on focus.
- Height 56dp. Input text Body Large. Floating label Body Small, resting label Body Large.
- Supporting text below in Body Small on-surface-variant. Error text replaces it and uses the error role, with an error icon so the state is not color alone.
- Outlined fields are the secondary option. Prefer filled for forms on tonal surfaces.
- Never rely on the placeholder as the label.
@@a11y
- The control sits inside (or is linked to) a <label>. The label text is the accessible name.
- Supporting and error text are linked with aria-describedby. An invalid field sets aria-invalid="true".
- Required fields use the required attribute plus a visible "required" cue in the label or supporting text.
- Use the right type and autocomplete values (email, tel, one-time-code) so assistive tech and password managers cooperate.
@@html
<div class="md-field-wrap">
  <label class="md-field">
    <input class="md-field__input" type="email" name="email" placeholder=" " autocomplete="email" aria-describedby="email-help" required>
    <span class="md-field__label">Email address</span>
  </label>
  <p class="md-field__support" id="email-help">We only use it to send the confirmation.</p>
</div>

<!-- error -->
<div class="md-field-wrap md-field-wrap--error">
  <label class="md-field">
    <input class="md-field__input" type="email" name="email2" placeholder=" " aria-invalid="true" aria-describedby="email2-err">
    <span class="md-field__label">Email address</span>
  </label>
  <p class="md-field__support" id="email2-err">
    <span class="md-icon" aria-hidden="true">error</span>
    Enter an address like name@example.com.
  </p>
</div>
@@css
.md-field-wrap { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--sp-xs); }

.md-field {
  position: relative;
  display: block;
  min-height: 3.5rem;
  border-radius: var(--shape-sm) var(--shape-sm) 0 0;
  background-color: var(--md-surface-4);
  box-shadow: inset 0 -0.0625rem 0 var(--md-on-surface-variant);
  transition:
    background-color var(--md-spring-fast-effects-dur) var(--md-spring-fast-effects),
    box-shadow var(--md-spring-fast-effects-dur) var(--md-spring-fast-effects);
}

.md-field:hover { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--md-on-surface) 8%, var(--md-surface-4)); }

.md-field:focus-within {
  box-shadow: inset 0 -0.125rem 0 var(--md-primary);
}

.md-field__input {
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 3.5rem;
  padding: 1.625rem var(--sp-lg) var(--sp-sm);
  border: 0;
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--md-on-surface);
  caret-color: var(--md-primary);
  font-family: var(--md-font-plain);
  font-size: var(--md-type-body-large-size);
  line-height: var(--md-type-body-large-line);
  letter-spacing: var(--md-type-body-large-tracking);
}

/* the field shows its own indicator, so the default ring would double up */
.md-field__input:focus-visible { outline: 0.1875rem solid transparent; }

.md-field__label {
  position: absolute;
  inset-inline: var(--sp-lg);
  top: 1rem;
  color: var(--md-on-surface-variant);
  font-size: var(--md-type-body-large-size);
  line-height: var(--md-type-body-large-line);
  pointer-events: none;
  transform-origin: left top;
  transition:
    transform var(--md-spring-fast-spatial-dur) var(--md-spring-fast-spatial),
    color var(--md-spring-fast-effects-dur) var(--md-spring-fast-effects);
}

/* floated: focused or holding a value (placeholder=" " makes :placeholder-shown reliable) */
.md-field__input:focus + .md-field__label,
.md-field__input:not(:placeholder-shown) + .md-field__label {
  transform: translateY(-0.625rem) scale(0.75);
}
.md-field:focus-within .md-field__label { color: var(--md-primary); }

.md-field__support {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--sp-xs);
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0 var(--sp-lg);
  color: var(--md-on-surface-variant);
  font-size: var(--md-type-body-small-size);
  line-height: var(--md-type-body-small-line);
  letter-spacing: var(--md-type-body-small-tracking);
}
.md-field__support .md-icon { font-size: 1rem; }

.md-field-wrap--error .md-field { box-shadow: inset 0 -0.125rem 0 var(--md-error); }
.md-field-wrap--error .md-field__label,
.md-field-wrap--error .md-field__support { color: var(--md-error); }

.md-field__input:disabled { color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--md-on-surface) 38%, transparent); cursor: not-allowed; }
